{
  "format": "coach_scenarios",
  "schema_version": 2,
  "model_version": "0.3",
  "purpose": "Shared test cases for the Python simulator and the C# port. Same file, same expected numbers.",
  "constants": {
    "tier_scale": 20,
    "weight_offence": 0.45,
    "weight_defence": 0.4,
    "weight_special_teams": 0.15,
    "coach_bonus_multiplier": 5,
    "k": 0.06,
    "home_advantage": 2.0,
    "xp_played": 5,
    "xp_win": 10,
    "xp_loss": 2,
    "coach_xp_base": 0.03,
    "coach_xp_rating_multiplier": 0.0004,
    "coach_xp_synergy": 0.02,
    "team_rating_baseline": 12,
    "team_rating_normalization": 1
  },
  "tolerances": {
    "strength": 0.01,
    "probability": 0.0005,
    "xp": 0.001
  },
  "notes": [
    "Coach bonus = round(average of the 4 role stats x 5), whole percentage points; empty slot = 0.",
    "Win XP is one grant per match: 5 played + 10 win = 15 base. Loss base is 5 + 2 = 7. Coach XP bonus applies on wins only.",
    "Facility multiplier is applied first, then the coach bonus, each with a minimum of 1 and no floor.",
    "Facilities do not change match strength (Prof. Easley, Oct 22).",
    "Special Teams strength unit uses all 14 roster slots (open question 6).",
    "Opponent strengths: 58.0 (spec average) and 63.9 (AI average in the 15-season test report).",
    "Expected values are calculated from the formulas, not copied from the engine.",
    "Every scenario has scenario_id and schema_version. input and expected are separate. All collections are explicit lists with named fields; no reader should rely on JSON key order.",
    "coach_state lists one row per role (O, D, ST). An empty slot has coach_name null, overall_rating 0, bonus_pct 0, win_xp_bonus 0.",
    "team_rating = team_rating_baseline + sum of the three bonus_pct, divided by team_rating_normalization (CoachesService.GetTeamRating). The Python engine has no team rating, so the Python test only checks it against the bonuses.",
    "win_xp_bonus per coach is 0.03 + 0.0004 x overall_rating for Offense and Defense; Special Teams has none. coach_win_bonus in xp is the sum plus 0.02 when both are hired."
  ],
